msgid "Restrict assistant to course subjects?"
msgstr "Limiter l'assistant aux sujets de cours ?"

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:107
msgid "The assistant will only answer questions related to the subjects above."
msgstr "L'assistant ne répondra qu'aux questions relatives aux sujets ci-dessus."

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:114
msgid "Can the assistant ask questions to the student?"
msgstr "L'assistant peut-il poser des questions à l'élève ?"

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:118
msgid "If enabled, the assistant can suggest questions to students."
msgstr "Si cette option est activée, l'assistant peut suggérer des questions aux étudiants."

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:125
msgid "Can the assistant use emojis?"
msgstr "L'assistant peut-il utiliser des émojis ?"

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:129
msgid "If enabled, the assistant can use emojis in its answers."
msgstr "Si cette option est activée, l'assistant peut utiliser des emojis dans ses réponses."

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:136
msgid "Should the assistant trust the provided document?"
msgstr "L'assistant doit-il faire confiance au document fourni ?"

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:140
msgid "If enabled, the assistant will use the provided document as a trusted source."
msgstr "Si cette option est activée, l'assistant utilisera le document fourni comme source fiable."

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:147
msgid "Allow students to redo this activity"
msgstr "Permettre aux élèves de refaire cette activité"

#: .\simbaapp\templates\popup_activity.html:151
